The 21C has set a number of production car lap records. In August 2021 Joel Miller set a time of 1:25.44 minutes around [[Laguna Seca]] using road legal [[Michelin]] Pilot Sport Cup2R tires and a high downforce track version of the car.<ref>{{cite web|title=Czinger’s 21C hypercar lapped Laguna Seca two seconds quicker than a McLaren Senna|url=https://www.topgear.com/car-news/supercars/czingers-21c-hypercar-lapped-laguna-seca-two-seconds-quicker-mclaren-senna|author=Rowan Horncastle|date=6 August 2021|access-date=1 October 2024}}</ref> This record was reclaimed in August 2024 once again by Joel Miller, setting a time of 1:24.75 minutes. <ref>{{cite web|title=CZINGER VEHICLES SECURES THIRD TRACK RECORD THIS SUMMER, RECLAIMS TITLE OF FASTEST LAP AT LAGUNA SECA|url=https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/czinger-vehicles-secures-third-track-record-this-summer-reclaims-title-of-fastest-lap-at-laguna-seca-302235127.html|author=Czinger Vehicles|website=prnewswire.com|date=30 August 2024|access-date=1 October 2024}}</ref> The 21C also set records in 2024 at the [[Goodwood Festival of Speed]] Hillclimb and the [[Circuit of the Americas]], with times of 48.82 seconds from Chris Ward,<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.goodwood.com/grr/event-coverage/festival-of-speed/video-on-board-the-czinger-21cs-record-breaking-fos-assault/|title=Video: On-board the Czinger 21C’s record-breaking FOS assault|author=Adam Wilkins|date=27 September 2024|access-date=1 October 2024}}</ref> and 2:10.70 minutes respectively.<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.topgear.com/car-news/motorsport/czinger-21c-now-production-car-record-holder-cota|title=The Czinger 21C is now the production car record holder at COTA|author=Shafiq Abidin|date=16 August 2024|access-date=1 October 2024}}</ref>On December 15, 2025, the 21C set a new track record for a production car at Laguna Seca, with a lap time of 1:22.30.

